sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Main
  participant Crawler
  participant Frontier
  participant Workers
  participant Fetcher
  participant Server
  User->>Main: crawl -n 1000 URL
  Main->>Crawler: crawl(fetcher::fetch, out, stderr)
  Crawler->>Frontier: pop()
  Frontier-->>Crawler: URL
  Crawler->>Workers: submit(URL)
  Workers->>Fetcher: fetch(URL)
  Fetcher->>Fetcher: pacer.acquire, set deadline
  Fetcher->>Server: HTTP/1.1 GET
  Server-->>Fetcher: status, headers, streamed body
  Fetcher-->>Workers: Page(status, links or failure)
  Workers-->>Crawler: Page
  Crawler->>Crawler: tracker.record(Page)
  Crawler-->>User: stdout: page line
  Crawler->>Frontier: push(each link)
  Crawler-->>User: stderr: summary after drain
